    "description": "Insomniac's flagship festival, now the largest electronic dance music festival in North America. The name predates Insomniac: 'Magical Mickey's Electric Daisy Carnival' was an underground party thrown by Stephen Hauptfuhr and Gary Richards in Chino, CA starting in 1991; Pasquale Rotella acquired use of the name in 1995 and debuted Insomniac's EDC at the Shrine Expo Hall in Los Angeles in 1997. After an LA-era spanning multiple Southern California venues (1997-2010), the festival moved to the Las Vegas Motor Speedway in 2011.",
